{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受文字有时过长，尤其S05只有18秒，却需要阅读多段叙事和完整感受句，比X的短词更难快速扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用【】突出每段叙事的关键动作、情绪和转折，普通观众即使没有读过原文，也更容易迅速抓住人物此刻在想什么、为什么这样做。感受部分从X相对零散的短词，变成与音乐变化相联系的具体体验，而且按音乐进程出现，既减少同时呈现的信息负担，也让人物的心理变化与音乐形成对应。尤其从最初不敢表达、逐渐享受亲近、害怕失去，到最后愿意坦然喜欢并接受未知，Y的前后连贯性和情绪层次更容易被感受到。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd8675e9-7cf6-4cb6-a58d-ad5f0aa3401c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T031859801504Z", "elapsed_seconds": 26.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:19:26.216371+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8d2338be75dbd789029bd19683d11df574c9aae7c60fd452d84bd710d137bc02", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\